  "_comment": "Shared vectors for the crypto payment rules and for the invoice's Dismiss and countdown rules (mmm/ZCASH-CONTRACT.md §4.4.2). invoiceDismiss: drop = the saved invoice is gone; keep = an account invoice stays saved and comes back at the next resume; hide = an invoice bought without a sign-in (network or code) stays saved, hidden. sdk/crypto_pay_test.go and sdk/crypto_invoice_view_controller_test.go (Go) and js/test/crypto_pay.test.ts and js/test/crypto_invoice.test.ts (TypeScript) replay every vector here, so the two implementations cannot drift. Addresses are synthetic fixtures; the Solana recipient is the sdk's fixture key, never the merchant. Countdown times: quoted_at and expires_at are the server's clock, received_at the device's when the quote arrived.",
